sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as React Client
  participant A as Express API
  participant DB as MongoDB
  U->>C: Enter email and password
  C->>A: POST /api/auth/login
  A->>DB: findOne(email) with +password
  DB-->>A: User document
  A->>A: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
  alt Credentials valid
    A->>A: generate access and refresh JWT
    A->>DB: save hashed refresh token
    A-->>C: 200 with tokens and user
    C->>C: store tokens, set MusicContext user
    C-->>U: Redirect to Home
  else Credentials invalid
    A-->>C: 401 Invalid credentials
    C-->>U: Show error message
  end
